      "cooked": "<p>So I saw <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A06-8IWjFSE\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Matilda the Musical</a> the other day, and it was really good. &nbsp;Has anybody else seen it? &nbsp;If not, you should. &nbsp;(I never read the book or saw the movie, by the way)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>It's also very British. &nbsp;Which has made me curious if those of you who <span class=\"bbcode-i\">are</span> British can identify the various things that make us Americans label the musical as such.</p>",
