      "cooked": "<p>THAT IS A GREAT MUSICAL YES VERY GOOD.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Which has made me curious if those of you who&nbsp; are &nbsp;British can identify the various things that make us Americans label the musical as such.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The fact that the pronunciation of Z as 'zed' is vital for one of the songs to work? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
